[PrintTextModified Text:ノアちゃんと同室だったんだね。<br>知らなくて、ほんとごめん。|#0101Adv09_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

